Lab-file parsers: dispense (Bioqore lab analyses; idea credit)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Source: github.com/Bioqore/ad_hoc_data_analyses (commit 82e6ae0, 2026-06-24),
the lab's media-experiment analyses.

Idea credit; re-implemented, no code copied. The ideas: a media sheet whose
input columns are dispense volumes ("uL to add") must not be read as
concentrations; converting volumes to final concentrations by C1V1 = C2V2 from
declared stock concentrations and the final volume; expanding a master mix into
its components so that no component is counted twice. Used in
kalos/ingest/dispense.py.

No data from that repository is included. The test fixtures are synthetic and
copy only the header layout of the lab's files.
